  "resume": "This record documents a petition submitted during the 2013 Youth Session concerning equal treatment between military and civil service, later archived as part of the National Council's 2017 session protocols. It includes statements by Jürg Stahl and is stored as a digital parliamentary record. The petition advocates for legislative parity between the two service types."
 },
